Cousine-Regular.ttf: Digitized data copyright (c) 2010 Google Corporation.
  License: SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1 (OFL-1.1.txt)
Karla-Regular.ttf: Copyright (c) 2011, Jonathan Pinhorn, with Reserved Font Names "Karla".
  License: SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1 (Karla-OFL.txt)
ProggyClean.ttf, ProggyTiny.ttf: by Tristan Grimmer.
  License: MIT (ProggyFonts-LICENSE.txt)

